"tanuki.news.heroesNG.title" : "Tanuki Don: Heroes and Forbidden Words!"
"tanuki.news.heroesNG.shortTitle" : "Tanuki Don: New voice roles"
"tanuki.news.heroesNG.subtitle" : "One word can change the game."
"tanuki.news.heroesNG.body" : "Version 0.1.0-β16 adds Super Hero, Evil Hero and the Forbidden Word modifier.<br><br>Press the ability button and say the Japanese word Henshin to transform. Your outfit changes, and you can kill and resist kills for the configured duration. The opposing hero can still kill you. Super Hero dies when attempting to kill a Crewmate. Transformation duration, cooldown and hiding names are configurable.<br><br>Enable Forbidden Word to randomly assign a word to every player from the host's TanukiBCL/NGWords.txt. Your own word appears on screen. Recognising it causes immediate death. Meeting detection is configurable.<br><br>Desktop players recognise their own microphone. The host recognises Web/mobile participants. No external speech recognition server is used.<br><br>Requires desktop/Lite v3.2.47+, .NET 3.2.47-net-beta.1+, or Web/mobile 3.39+. Update the addon and voice client for every participant. Recognition errors may occur."
